ill reach someone: the Nemesis clock moves on.","r":{"cred":70,"nemClock":1},"fl":{"greed":1,"loud":1}},{"k":"lance","l":"Cut the vault open with a lance","s":"+70 credits, quietly.","need":{"kind":"lance"},"r":{"cred":70},"fl":{"greed":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Leave it sealed","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"pilot","t":"A stranded pilot","b":"A lone life pod drifts across your course. Inside, a fighter pilot clutches the logbook of a wing that no longer exists.","o":[{"k":"take","l":"Take her aboard","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 40 experience from her stories.","r":{"xpLow":40},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"k":"wing","l":"Give her a wing on your carrier","s":"Your best carrier’s wings gain a veteran perk.","need":{"carrier":1},"r":{"wingPerk":1},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Leave her to the rescue buoys","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"reactor","t":"A cracked reactor","b":"Engineers report a hairline crack in a reactor housing. It will hold for a battle, perhaps two.","o":[{"k":"vent","l":"Vent and patch it","s":"Your largest ship takes 20% hull damage.","r":{"dmgBig":"#d:3fc999999999999a"}},{"k":"refit","l":"Rebuild it around a spare refit","s":"A refit from the hold is used up. No damage.","need":{"mod":1},"r":{"payMod":1}},{"k":"metal","l":"Let the living metal knit it","s":"No cost.","need":{"fac":"deathless"},"r":{}},{"k":"pay","l":"Buy parts from a passing hauler (45 credits)","s":"No damage.","r":{"cost":45}}]},{"id":"squall","t":"Ion squall","b":"A wall of ion static rolls toward the fleet. It will scour paint, sensors and anything not shielded.","o":[{"k":"ride","l":"Ride it out","s":"Every ship takes 8% hull damage.","r":{"dmgAll":"#d:3fb47ae147ae147b"}},{"k":"shield","l":"Bring the shields up and push through","s":"No damage; captains learn from it: +10 experience each.","need":{"shields":1},"r":{"xp":10}},{"k":"round","l":"Go around (35 credits of fuel)","s":"No damage.","r":{"cost":35}}]},{"id":"broker","t":"An information broker","b":"A soft-spoken broker hails you from a cloaked yacht. She claims to know the enemy commander who has been shadowing your fleet.","o":[{"k":"buy","l":"Buy what she knows (60 credits)","s":"A Nemesis weakness is revealed.","r":{"cost":60,"nemIntel":1},"fl":{"intel":1}},{"k":"debt","l":"Remind her of an old debt","s":"She pays it in secrets: a Nemesis weakness, free.","need":{"fac":"corsair"},"r":{"nemIntel":1},"fl":{"intel":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Send her away","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"bait","t":"A distress call that sounds wrong","b":"A freighter screams for help on every band. Your signals officer thinks the voice is a recording.","o":[{"k":"loud","l":"Go in loud and take the cargo","s":"+80 credits, but your next fight starts as an ambush.","r":{"cred":80,"ambush":true},"fl":{"greed":1,"loud":1}},{"k":"sweep","l":"Sweep it with point defense first","s":"You find the mines and take the cargo: +80 credits.","need":{"kind":"flak"},"r":{"cred":80},"fl":{"greed":1}},{"k":"ignore","l":"Ignore it","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"spawn","t":"A spawning field","b":"Thousands of translucent egg-sacs drift between two moons, pulsing in time with something far away.","o":[{"k":"burn","l":"Burn them","s":"+20 experience for every captain.","r":{"xp":20},"fl":{"purge":1}},{"k":"harvest","l":"Harvest the membranes","s":"Gain a damage control refit.","r":{"modId":"damcon"}},{"k":"feed","l":"Let the fleet feed","s":"Every ship regrows 30% of its hull.","need":{"fac":"chorus"},"r":{"healAll":"#d:3fd3333333333333"},"fl":{"fed":1}}]},{"id":"lament","t":"A song in the dark","b":"A dying Ithar songship is singing its own lament. The melody carries old star charts in it, for those who can hear.","o":[{"k":"listen","l":"Listen","s":"Every captain gains 15 experience.","r":{"xp":15}},{"k":"join","l":"Join the song","s":"Gain a relic, and the charts show you the enemy commander’s routes: Nemesis clock back one.","need":{"fac":"ithar"},"r":{"relic":1,"nemClock":-1}},{"k":"archive","l":"Trade a relic for its archive","s":"Lose a relic. Reveal a Nemesis weakness and gain 120 credits.","need":{"relic":1},"r":{"payRelic":1,"nemIntel":1,"cred":120},"fl":{"intel":1}}]},{"id":"tomb","not":["deathless"],"t":"A sealed tomb-world","b":"A planet of black glass hums under your keels. Deep below, something counts the seconds until it wakes.","o":[{"k":"wake","l":"Wake it and take what it guards","s":"Fight an elite Deathless battle. Win a relic.","r":{"fight":"deathless"},"fl":{"loud":1}},{"k":"map","l":"Map it from orbit and leave","s":"+30 credits for the charts.","r":{"cred":30}}]},{"id":"tombhome","not":["hegemony","voidsworn","corsair","chorus","ithar"],"t":"A sleeping tomb-world","b":"A tomb-world of your own dynasty, its legions dormant. A word from you would wake one of them.","o":[{"k":"wake","l":"Wake one scythe","s":"A Deathless scythe joins the fleet at full hull.","need":{"fac":"deathless"},"r":{"shipRaw":"d_scythe"}},{"k":"tithe","l":"Take its tithe instead","s":"+60 credits.","r":{"cred":60}}]},{"id":"mutiny","t":"Mutters below decks","b":"The crew of one of your ships has gone quiet in the wrong way. Their captain asks for orders.","o":[{"k":"pay","l":"Pay a bonus (50 credits)","s":"The mood lifts.","r":{"cost":50}},{"k":"discipline","l":"Make an example","s":"Your flagship captain loses 20 experience; the fleet falls in line.","r":{"payXp":20}},{"k":"talk","l":"Send your most senior captain to talk","s":"Free, and that captain gains 15 experience.","need":{"vet":2},"r":{"xpTop":15},"fl":{"mercy":1}}]},{"id":"convoy","t":"A merchant convoy","b":"A slow convoy of ore haulers asks for safe passage through the next system.","o":[{"k":"escort","l":"Escort them","s":"+45 credits from the grateful masters.","r":{"cred":45},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"k":"trade","l":"Trade with them (60 credits)","s":"Gain a random refit.","r":{"cost":60,"mod":1}},{"k":"shake","l":"Shake them down","s":"+100 credits. Word spreads: the Nemesis clock moves on.","need":{"fac":"corsair"},"r":{"cred":100,"nemClock":1},"fl":{"greed":1,"loud":1}}]},{"id":"battlefield","t":"The old battlefield","b":"Hulls from a war nobody remembers drift in a slow ring, still bristling with unexploded ordnance.","o":[{"k":"salvage","l":"Salvage carefully","s":"Gain a random refit. One ship takes 12% hull damage from old mines.","r":{"mod":1,"dmgOne":"#d:3fbeb851eb851eb8"}},{"k":"wings","l":"Send the wings in first","s":"They find the mines: a random refit, no damage.","need":{"carrier":1},"r":{"mod":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Leave it to the dead","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"scout","t":"A scout in your wake","b":"Long-range scans show a small, fast ship holding exactly at the edge of your sensor range. It carries the enemy commander’s colours.","o":[{"k":"hunt","l":"Turn and hunt it down","s":"Every ship takes 5% hull damage in the chase. Nemesis clock back one, and a weakness revealed.","r":{"dmgAll":"#d:3fa999999999999a","nemClock":-1,"nemIntel":1}},{"k":"torp","l":"Torpedo it from range","s":"Nemesis clock back one, and a weakness revealed. No damage.","need":{"kind":"torp"},"r":{"nemClock":-1,"nemIntel":1}},{"k":"ignore","l":"Let it watch","s":"The Nemesis clock moves on.","r":{"nemClock":1}}]},{"id":"defector","t":"A defector","b":"An officer from the enemy commander’s own fleet surrenders his shuttle to you. He wants asylum and he wants revenge.","o":[{"k":"question","l":"Interrogate him","s":"A Nemesis weakness is revealed.","r":{"nemIntel":1},"fl":{"intel":1}},{"k":"ransom","l":"Sell him back","s":"+70 credits. The Nemesis clock moves on.","r":{"cred":70,"nemClock":1},"fl":{"greed":1}},{"k":"enlist","l":"Give him a commission","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 50 experience and a weakness is revealed.","need":{"fac":"hegemony"},"r":{"xpLow":50,"nemIntel":1},"fl":{"intel":1}}]},{"id":"dock","t":"A drifting drydock","b":"An automated drydock still runs on its last power cells. Its arms twitch as your fleet comes alon