,"r":{"cred":100,"ambush":true,"nemClock":1},"fl":{"greed":1}},{"l":"Ignore it","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"astropath","t":"A signal in the static","b":"Your signals officer has pulled an old founders’ beacon out of the static. Old salvage lies beyond it, but reaching it means crossing a rift.","v":{"hegemony":{"t":"A ghost signal","b":"Your sensor officer has decoded a ghost signal: an old Navy salvage cache, deep inside a rift."},"corsair":{"t":"The tracker’s nose","b":"Your best tracker swears she can smell old metal on the far side of a rift. She is usually right. Usually."},"chorus":{"t":"A scent in the dark","b":"The swarm tastes something old and delicious beyond a rift."},"ithar":{"t":"A glint beyond the rift","b":"Your mirrors catch a glint of old Starwright glass beyond a rift: a lost treasure of your people."},"deathless":{"t":"An Archive beacon","b":"An Archive beacon from before the collapse pulses beyond a rift. Something of Ardent is still out there."}},"o":[{"l":"Go after it","s":"Gain salvage. A random ship takes heavy damage.","r":{"relic":1,"dmgOne":"#d:3fd3333333333333"}},{"k":"shield","l":"Shield the route with a spare refit","s":"Gain salvage. A refit from the hold burns out instead of a hull.","need":{"mod":1},"r":{"relic":1,"payMod":1}},{"l":"Move on","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"merc","t":"A mercenary captain","b":"A scarred destroyer captain hails you. Her crew has been paid off and she wants a new cause, for a price.","o":[{"l":"Hire her (80 credits)","s":"A destroyer of your own kind, with a veteran captain, joins the fleet.","r":{"cost":80,"ship":"harrow","vet":1}},{"k":"oath","l":"Offer her a place in the line, no pay","s":"She takes the oath. A destroyer of your own kind joins with a veteran captain.","need":{"fac":"voidsworn"},"r":{"ship":"harrow","vet":1}},{"l":"Decline","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"storm","t":"Rift storm","b":"A storm front rolls across your jump route, lightning the colour of old blood.","o":[{"l":"Punch straight through","s":"Every ship takes 10% hull damage.","r":{"dmgAll":"#d:3fb999999999999a"}},{"k":"shields","l":"Angle every shield into the front","s":"No damage, and your captains learn from it: +10 experience each.","need":{"shields":1},"r":{"xp":10}},{"l":"Chart a way around (40 credits)","s":"Burn fuel and time instead.","r":{"cost":40}}]},{"id":"seer","not":["ithar"],"t":"A Glasswright wanderer","b":"A lone Glasswright vessel matches your course. Its keeper offers a trade: one of your refits for one of their treasures.","o":[{"l":"Trade a module for salvage","s":"Lose a random installed module. Gain salvage.","r":{"loseMod":1,"relic":1}},{"k":"song","l":"Answer her tone in glass","s":"She trades salvage for the courtesy. No refit lost.","need":{"fac":"ithar"},"r":{"relic":1}},{"l":"Refuse politely","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"wright","t":"The rogue shipwright","b":"A hermit shipwright on an asteroid forge offers to rework one of your hulls. He asks only for the stories of your battles.","o":[{"l":"Let him work","s":"Your most damaged ship is fully repaired and upgraded one Mark.","r":{"upgradeOne":1}},{"k":"pay","l":"Pay him in refits too (one from the hold)","s":"Your most damaged ship is repaired and upgraded, and a second ship is fully repaired.","need":{"mod":1},"r":{"upgradeOne":1,"repairOne":1,"payMod":1}},{"l":"Move on","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"moon","not":["chorus"],"t":"The infested moon","b":"Chorus spores have taken a mining moon. Survivors are signalling from the deep shafts, but a brood is gestating.","o":[{"l":"Purge the moon","s":"Fight an elite Chorus battle. Win salvage.","r":{"fight":"chorus"}},{"k":"flak","l":"Sweep the shafts with point defense","s":"Rescue the survivors before the brood hatches: +60 credits, +15 experience for every captain.","need":{"kind":"flak"},"r":{"cred":60,"xp":15},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"l":"Bombard from orbit and leave","s":"+20 captain experience for every captain.","r":{"xp":20}}]},{"id":"shrine","not":["chorus","deathless"],"t":"A wall of names","b":"A memorial station hangs over a dead world, its walls chalked with the names of a crusade that never came home. Your crews ask to leave an offering.","v":{"hegemony":{"b":"An old memorial station hangs over a dead world. Spacers are a superstitious lot, and your crews ask to leave an offering."},"corsair":{"b":"An old memorial station hangs over a dead world, heaped with other packs’ trophies. Your crews want to leave one of their own."},"ithar":{"t":"A mirror of the old world","b":"A mirror array from before your people’s fall still turns over a dead world. Your crews ask to leave an offering."}},"o":[{"l":"Offer 50 credits","s":"Every ship repairs 30% hull.","r":{"cost":50,"healAll":"#d:3fd3333333333333"}},{"l":"Chalk your names and hope","s":"Even odds: repair 30%, or nothing.","r":{"gamble":true}},{"k":"relic","l":"Leave a piece of salvage as an offering","s":"Every ship is fully repaired and every captain gains 20 experience.","need":{"relic":1},"r":{"payRelic":1,"healAll":1,"xp":20}},{"l":"Leave","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"deserters","not":["hegemony"],"t":"Hegemony deserters","b":"An escape pod of Hegemony officers begs for asylum. They know how the Navy fights.","o":[{"l":"Take them in","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 60 experience.","r":{"xpLow":60}},{"k":"question","l":"Question them about the enemy commander","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 30 experience and a Nemesis weakness is revealed.","need":{"vet":2},"r":{"xpLow":30,"nemIntel":1}},{"l":"Hand them back for the bounty","s":"+60 credits.","r":{"cred":60}}]},{"id":"cache","not":["corsair"],"t":"Smuggler cache","b":"A Hullbreaker cache hidden in the rings of a gas giant. The locks are primitive.","o":[{"l":"Crack it open","s":"Gain a random module.","r":{"mod":1}},{"k":"both","l":"Crack it with a torpedo, then strip the fuel","s":"A refit and the credits.","need":{"kind":"torp"},"r":{"mod":1,"cred":45}},{"l":"Take the fuel and credits","s":"+45 credits.","r":{"cred":45}}]},{"id":"tithe","t":"The toll vault","b":"An abandoned toll station turns slowly in the dark, its vault still sealed. The alarm circuits look old, but alive.","o":[{"k":"crack","l":"Blow the vault","s":"+70 credits. The alarm will reach someone: the Nemesis clock moves on.","r":{"cred":70,"nemClock":1},"fl":{"greed":1,"loud":1}},{"k":"lance","l":"Cut the vault open with a lance","s":"+70 credits, quietly.","need":{"kind":"lance"},"r":{"cred":70},"fl":{"greed":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Leave it sealed","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"pilot","t":"A stranded pilot","b":"A lone life pod drifts across your course. Inside, a fighter pilot clutches the logbook of a wing that no longer exists.","o":[{"k":"take","l":"Take her aboard","s":"Your least experienced captain gains 40 experience from her stories.","r":{"xpLow":40},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"k":"wing","l":"Give her a wing on your carrier","s":"Your best carrier’s wings gain a veteran perk.","need":{"carrier":1},"r":{"wingPerk":1},"fl":{"mercy":1}},{"k":"leave","l":"Leave her to the rescue buoys","s":"Nothing happens.","r":{}}]},{"id":"reactor","t":"A cracked reactor","b":"Engineers report a hairline crack in a reactor housing. It will hold for a battle, perhaps two.","o":[{"k":"vent","l":"Vent and patch it","s":"Your largest ship takes 20% hull damage.","r":{"dmgBig":"#d:3fc999999999999a"}},{"k":"refit","l":"Rebuild it around a spare refit","s":"A refit from the hold is used up. No damage.","need":{"mod":1},"r":{"payMod":1}},{"k":"metal","l":"Let the repair drones knit it","s":"No cost.","need":{"fac":"deathless"},"r":{}},{"k":"pay","l":"Buy parts from a passing hauler (45 credits)","s":"No damage.","r":{"cost":45}}]},{"id":"squall","t":"Ion squall","b":"A wall of ion static rolls toward the fleet. It will scour paint, sensors and anything not shielded.","o":[{"k":"ride","l":"Ride it out","s":"Every ship takes 8% hull damage.","